      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "There should be a way for them to know but Steam users are far from guest users. We are full fledged users. I would however switch over if my friends list could be transferred, but since there are no good ways to communicate and add friends without being right in front of them, it's fairly impossible to move without losing people, which is something I cannot afford.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "5af95395de233b04c53c669e",
      "author": {
        "_id": "58c6b8f8227a56787575ebc0",
        "alias": "Iris Hummingbird",
        "aliasID": "65ba012ced6eefce4cea0f6a",
