      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "5af8781256feb85f400884b0",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "Steam accounts do not have the same capabilities as a VRchat account (Uploading content, logging into the website..) so I would argue that they are not fully fledged users, because they still lack those basic things. They can access the game client and play, nothing else, which to me \"guest account\" is a pretty good name for.\n\nThis might be very tedious if you got a lot of people, but you can in-game open the social menu and use the search bar to find people and add them there or login to the website, search for people and add them as friends in your browser.\nA way to transfer friends would be super nice and make the transition much, much better however I doubt that is a priority for the team unfortunately",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
