      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "@{58c6b8f8227a56787575ebc0|full_name}: They are fully fledged users, you don't need to logon to the site to do anything and content uploads make sense since there is no user to tie to. \n\nIt's not a guest account as your account is persistent, last avatar used saves and your friends list saves.\n\nIf anything, they should allow us to tie our Steam account to our VRC account so we don't have to worry.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
