  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-05-13T17:38:26.762Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Now that the content gating trust system is in place I feel it's more important than ever to make it super obvious that steam accounts cannot upload content.\n\nThere have already been several users not realizing it and been waiting for very, very long times for their steam accounts to be \"accepted\" when in reality that will never happen.\n\nRenaming them to \"guest accounts\" should be a good solution to that as the name implies you cannot do much with it.",
